# The ruins of the far Sevii Islands (FireRed's dungeon theme of Dotted Hole, Tanoby Key and the Tanoby Chambers): a
# slow, hushed air in A minor, a bell's few notes over a choir's long chords, a drone of deep bass and drops of
# glockenspiel, for old stone rooms that nobody has walked in for a long time. The same by day and night, as the
# islands' caves. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K9, part b).
title Sevii Ruins
tempo 76
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5
night none

track lead bell vol=0.76 pan=0 rev=0.55
  L o5 e2 a4 r4 | o5 c2. r4 | o5 f2 a4 r4 | o5 g+2. r4 |
  o5 a2 e4 r4 | o5 d2 f4 r4 | o5 e2 g+4 b4 | o5 b2. r4 |
  o5 a2 o6 c4 r4 | o5 b2 o6 d4 r4 | o6 c2. r4 | o5 b2 g+4 r4 |
  o5 a2 f4 r4 | o5 g+2 e4 r4 | o5 e2 c4 r4 | o5 a2. r4 |

track drops glockenspiel vol=0.2 pan=-0.35 rev=0.65
  L [ r2 o5 e8 r8 r4 | r4 r8 o5 a8 r2 | ]8

track pad choir vol=0.44 pan=0.25 rev=0.6
  L o4 (a >c e)1 | (a >c e)1 | (f a >c)1 | (e g+ b)1 |
  (a >c e)1 | (d f a)1 | (e g+ b)1 | (e g+ b)1 |
  (f a >c)1 | (g b >d)1 | (a >c e)1 | (e g+ b)1 |
  (d f a)1 | (e g+ b)1 | (a >c e)1 | (a >c e)1 |

track bass contrabass vol=0.74 rev=0.3
  L o2 a1 | a1 | f1 | e1 |
  a1 | d1 | e1 | e1 |
  f1 | g1 | a1 | e1 |
  d1 | e1 | a1 | a1 |

track drums kit vol=0.2 rev=0.4
  v45 L [ b4 r4 r2 | r2 b8 r8 r4 | ]8
